        "id": 13824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T16:05:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The big thing we get from SkMatrix here is `rectStaysRect()`, is it worth implementing that in Transform? (We also use `preservesRightAngles()` and `isSimilarity()` in RectBlurData::Make, but I suppose we could convert from SkMatrix to Transform when passing the matrix to MakeRect)",
