      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T18:25:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For `Transform`, you can check `t.type() \u003c\u003d Transform::Type::kRectStaysRect`. If `preservesRightAngles()` is valuable, `Transform` calculates all the right information to add a `kOrthogonal` type that is equivalent to preserves-right-angles.",
      "parentUuid": "ee0abb0f_3cf49a8e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 81
