      "writtenOn": "2024-04-10T21:03:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I started trying to use Transform here where possible but I\u0027ve concluded that there\u0027s so much SkMatrix-specific functionality used here that it\u0027s not worth porting that to Transform in this CL, and therefore we need an SkMatrix from the very beginning of `RectBlurData::Make()`. I added a todo about expanding functionality in Transform.",
