      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will we be able to have a single RenderStep for all the shape types? If not, the different rendersteps/renderers will trigger new pipelines so then they can just call the direct blur function and the renderstep can drop the type enum.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1466,
