      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T16:05:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s definitely possible to handle all the shape types with a single RenderStep. There are at least a few shape-specific inputs: isFast and invSixSigma for rects, cornerRadius and blurRadius for rrects. So e.g. for circle we might be passing in unused inputs, and we might have to pass in isRect as a half float for the inputs to be as condensed as possible. The idea here of course is to reduce the number of shaders.",
